<title>JAPAN: Volvo Group Finance launches yen/dlr samurai-Nikko.</title>
<headline>Volvo Group Finance launches yen/dlr samurai-Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual samurai issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Monday:</p>
<p>BORROWER Volvo Group Finance Sweden AB</p>
<p>    AMT	25 bln yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   5.0 pct</p>
<p>MATURITY 14 March 2000  </p>
<p> ISS PRICE	  par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  14 March 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	March 3 to March 13</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     NIS A+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Sanwa Bank</p>
<p>NOTE: The exchange rate was fixed at $8,145.98 to 1,000,000 yen. -- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
